%% Module 2 preview - rkdma packet arrival path
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant HW as Device
  participant TH as IRQ top half
  participant BH as Threaded IRQ / bottom half
  participant RING as mmap'd RX ring
  participant APP as Userspace reader

  HW->>HW: DMA payload into mapped buffer
  HW->>TH: assert interrupt
  TH->>TH: ack and mask device IRQ
  TH-->>BH: wake threaded handler
  Note over TH: minimal work only - no sleeping, no allocation

  loop bounded budget (NAPI style)
    BH->>HW: read completed descriptor
    BH->>BH: dma_sync_single_for_cpu
    BH->>RING: publish index with release store
  end

  BH->>HW: unmask IRQ when budget unspent
  RING-->>APP: acquire load of producer index
  APP->>APP: process in place - zero copies
  APP->>RING: publish consumer index (release)
